			dependencies: ["19D35B010B678675"]
			description: [
				"Spectrum 是一款独特而复杂的魔法模组。它是本整合包的主要魔法模组，请务必阅读此任务中的信息。"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"In Spectrum, most items &odon't have their true texture&r until you unlock the necessary &5advancements&r for that block/item. "
